### CinemaAbyss Monolith Service HTTP Tests
### RFC 2616 compliant HTTP requests for testing Monolith Service
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiPath = /api

### ===========================================
### Health Check Tests
### ===========================================

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### ===========================================
### Users API Tests
### ===========================================

### Get All Users
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/users
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Get User by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/users?id=1
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Create User
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "username": "test_user_http",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

###

### ===========================================
### Movies API Tests
### ===========================================

### Get All Movies
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Get Movie by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies?id=1
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Create Movie
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "title": "HTTP Test Movie",
  "description": "A movie created via HTTP tests",
  "rating": 8.5,
  "genres": ["Drama", "Test"]
}

###

### ===========================================
### Payments API Tests
### ===========================================

### Get All Payments
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/payments
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Get Payment by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/payments?id=1
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Get Payments by User ID
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/payments?user_id=1
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Create Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "amount": 29.99
}

###

### ===========================================
### Subscriptions API Tests
### ===========================================

### Get All Subscriptions
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/subscriptions
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Get Subscription by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/subscriptions?id=1
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Get Subscriptions by User ID
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/subscriptions?user_id=1
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Create Subscription
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "plan_type": "premium",
  "start_date": "2024-01-15T00:00:00Z",
  "end_date": "2024-02-15T00:00:00Z"
}

